# A 4-by-5 grid with four options per node and arbitrary finite costs.
# Costs sampled with Python random.Random(1). Unary entries in node
# order use range(5). Edges are visited by source, horizontal before
# vertical, with row-major entries from range(9).
# Run from the repository root.
# Baseline: ./build-clang-modules/pbqp --solve=bnb -O1 -Werror --numthreads=1 --verbose -fno-bucket-seed examples/pbqp/individual/bnb-bucket-seed.pbqp
# Enabled:  ./build-clang-modules/pbqp --solve=bnb -O1 -Werror --numthreads=1 --verbose -fbucket-seed examples/pbqp/individual/bnb-bucket-seed.pbqp
# Both runs proved COST 71. The enabled run improved its seed from 73 to 71.
# Clang 21 Release, Intel Core Ultra X7 358H; median of nine alternating
# CLI runs per configuration: baseline 140.55 ms, enabled 103.15 ms.

